{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":26,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":26,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f380beecf50d3847f7e8","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That’s a lot of work before 9 a.m. — crying it out in the car, wiping your face, and walking in with “good morning” like nothing happened. That’s not nothing. That’s a performance you’ve gotten very good at.\n\nAnd it’s the same move as the driveway, isn’t it? Swallow it, keep the surface calm, protect everyone from the weight of it. With him, it reads as a closed door. At work, nobody sees it at all.\n\nCan I ask — what are the mornings about? Is it the relationship, the job, or just the accumulation of holding everything in? And is there anyone at all — not necessarily him — who you don’t have to wipe your face for?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That’s a lot of work before 9 a.m. — crying it out in the car, wiping your face, and walking in with “good morning” like nothing happened. That’s not nothing. That’s a performance you’ve gotten very good at.\n\nAnd it’s the same move as the driveway, isn’t it? Swallow it, keep the surface calm, protect everyone from the weight of it. With him, it reads as a closed door. At work, nobody sees it at all.\n\nCan I ask — what are the mornings about? Is it the relationship, the job, or just the accumulation of holding everything in? And is there anyone at all — not necessarily him — who you don’t have to wipe your face for?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":5617,"promptTokens":1543,"completionTokens":714,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:32"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":27,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"227a5d68447a48ea86eb5cabc38fd375","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002472564707901976,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f380beecf50d3847f7e7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486592643,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:32","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f380beecf50d3847f7e7","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"no. nobody. i wipe my face and go in and say good morning to everybody like its nothing","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":26,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"227a5d68447a48ea86eb5cabc38fd375","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002472564707901976,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":2,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":2,"sort":9},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6b04f380beecf50d3847f7e8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486592640,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:32","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f378beecf50d3847f7e0","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That’s the real fear under all of this — not the sentence itself, but what the sentence reveals about you, and whether he’ll re-file you from “partner” to “situation.”\n\nI want to gently push on one thing, though: “somebody steady” might be a role you assigned yourself rather than one he asked for. He told you he feels like a boarder — that’s not a man asking for a pillar. That’s a man asking to be let in. Steadiness and honesty aren’t opposites; the version of steady that requires you to disappear isn’t steady, it’s just quiet.\n\nAnd separately from him — crying in the car before work every morning is its own thing. Not because it makes you fragile or unlovable, but because that’s a lot to carry alone, and it sounds like it’s been going on a while. Does anyone know about the mornings?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That’s the real fear under all of this — not the sentence itself, but what the sentence reveals about you, and whether he’ll re-file you from “partner” to “situation.”\n\nI want to gently push on one thing, though: “somebody steady” might be a role you assigned yourself rather than one he asked for. He told you he feels like a boarder — that’s not a man asking for a pillar. That’s a man asking to be let in. Steadiness and honesty aren’t opposites; the version of steady that requires you to disappear isn’t steady, it’s just quiet.\n\nAnd separately from him — crying in the car before work every morning is its own thing. Not because it makes you fragile or unlovable, but because that’s a lot to carry alone, and it sounds like it’s been going on a while. Does anyone know about the mornings?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3509,"promptTokens":1326,"completionTokens":384,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:24"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":25,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"30e1e8f102d549eea4045f55aef1727c","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":2.611870584562247E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f378beecf50d3847f7df","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486584768,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:24","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f378beecf50d3847f7df","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"that hes got somebody steady. if he finds out im crying in the car before work every morning hes going to look at me different, like im another thing that needs handling","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"30e1e8f102d549eea4045f55aef1727c","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":2.611870584562247E-4,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":7,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":7,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6b04f378beecf50d3847f7e0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486584764,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:24","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f372beecf50d3847f7d9","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That’s a very specific fear — not that he’ll be cruel, but that he’ll switch into caretaker mode and the conversation will become about managing you instead of hearing you. And then the easy, ordinary version of the two of you feels gone.\n\nTwo things might help separate that.\n\nOne: you can name the crying before it happens. “I might cry. I’m okay. You don’t have to fix it — I just need you to listen for a minute.” That gives him a job other than “ask if you’re okay every five minutes.”\n\nTwo: you don’t have to deliver it live and perfectly. You could write it down and hand it to him, or read it. Crying while he reads is allowed. The words still get there.\n\nBut I want to ask about the last part — “it never goes back to how it was before he knew.” What is the “it” you’re afraid of losing? The ease? The way he looks at you? Something else?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That’s a very specific fear — not that he’ll be cruel, but that he’ll switch into caretaker mode and the conversation will become about managing you instead of hearing you. And then the easy, ordinary version of the two of you feels gone.\n\nTwo things might help separate that.\n\nOne: you can name the crying before it happens. “I might cry. I’m okay. You don’t have to fix it — I just need you to listen for a minute.” That gives him a job other than “ask if you’re okay every five minutes.”\n\nTwo: you don’t have to deliver it live and perfectly. You could write it down and hand it to him, or read it. Crying while he reads is allowed. The words still get there.\n\nBut I want to ask about the last part — “it never goes back to how it was before he knew.” What is the “it” you’re afraid of losing? The ease? The way he looks at you? Something else?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3454,"promptTokens":1077,"completionTokens":374,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:18"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":23,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"e1d320707e3845be8ee76bc25cddb45d","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002182677415668826,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f372beecf50d3847f7d8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486578871,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f372beecf50d3847f7d8","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"i start crying so hard i cant even get the words out. and then he switches into fixing it and asking if im ok every five minutes, and it never goes back to how it was before he knew","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":22,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":null,"isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002182677415668826,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":7,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":7,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":2,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2}],"relationId":"6b04f372beecf50d3847f7d9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486578868,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f36dbeecf50d3847f7d0","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That’s the trap: the smaller sentence opens a door you don’t feel ready to walk through. But you don’t have to choose between “nothing” and “the whole thing falling out” in that exact second.\n\nYou can answer his “what was it?” with a holding sentence, not the content: “I do want to tell you. I’m not dodging — I just want to say it when I’m not going to botch it. Give me until we’re in the car tonight.” That keeps the door open without dumping everything on the driveway.\n\nAnd if the whole thing does fall out — messy, out of order — is that actually the disaster? Or is the scary part his reaction, or yours?\n\nWhat’s the worst version of it falling out?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That’s the trap: the smaller sentence opens a door you don’t feel ready to walk through. But you don’t have to choose between “nothing” and “the whole thing falling out” in that exact second.\n\nYou can answer his “what was it?” with a holding sentence, not the content: “I do want to tell you. I’m not dodging — I just want to say it when I’m not going to botch it. Give me until we’re in the car tonight.” That keeps the door open without dumping everything on the driveway.\n\nAnd if the whole thing does fall out — messy, out of order — is that actually the disaster? Or is the scary part his reaction, or yours?\n\nWhat’s the worst version of it falling out?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3819,"promptTokens":869,"completionTokens":479,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:13"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":21,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"28d91caa909e4258a065f14deea51f3b","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":3.3534697362582356E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f36dbeecf50d3847f7cf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486573161,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f36dbeecf50d3847f7cf","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"thats smaller, yeah. but the second i say that he's going to ask what it was and then im standing there with nothing, or with the whole thing falling out","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"28d91caa909e4258a065f14deea51f3b","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":3.3534697362582356E-4,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":2,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":2,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1}],"relationId":"6b04f36dbeecf50d3847f7d0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486573158,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f367beecf50d3847f7c8","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"Exactly — he can’t read the intention behind the silence. From your side it’s “I’m protecting you”; from his side it’s just blank space where words should be.\n\nYou don’t necessarily have to hand him the whole sentence to change that. You could hand him the fact that it exists: “I had something I wanted to say in the driveway, and I dropped it because you’d had a double.” That’s smaller than the sentence, but it tells him the silence isn’t emptiness.\n\nDoes that feel possible, or does even that feel like too much right now?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Exactly — he can’t read the intention behind the silence. From your side it’s “I’m protecting you”; from his side it’s just blank space where words should be.\n\nYou don’t necessarily have to hand him the whole sentence to change that. You could hand him the fact that it exists: “I had something I wanted to say in the driveway, and I dropped it because you’d had a double.” That’s smaller than the sentence, but it tells him the silence isn’t emptiness.\n\nDoes that feel possible, or does even that feel like too much right now?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":4241,"promptTokens":705,"completionTokens":539,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:07"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"dcbc66fa9376441ab3ae9d38e9a08dc0","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0013249953495167769,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f367beecf50d3847f7c7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486567060,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:07","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f367beecf50d3847f7c7","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"no. how would he. from his side it probably just looks like i dont have anything to say to him","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"dcbc66fa9376441ab3ae9d38e9a08dc0","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0013249953495167769,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6b04f367beecf50d3847f7c8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486567057,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:07","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f360beecf50d3847f7c1","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"Yeah — the thing you did to keep him company is the same thing that reads to him as a closed door. That's a rough place to be standing.\n\nDoes he know that's what you were doing?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"Yeah — the thing you did to keep him company is the same thing that reads to him as a closed door. That's a rough place to be standing.\n\nDoes he know that's what you were doing?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1404,"promptTokens":637,"completionTokens":131,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:00"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":17,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"884d7418311e4096a39c2e31bf0df350","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":2.959524457147513E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f360beecf50d3847f7c0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486560817,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:16:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f360beecf50d3847f7c0","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"huh. so me being quiet about it is the exact thing he's complaining about. i kept him company and it still came out like a shut door to him","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":16,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":null,"isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":2.959524457147513E-4,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"so